triage:PhaseBB a triage:Phase .

# Order follows docs/plans/phase-bb/phase-bb-plan.md sec.3/5: wave 1 is
# BB.1/BB.2/BB.3 in parallel off integrate/phase-bb; BB.4 stacks on BB.1
# (must_follow dev push), BB.5 on BB.4, BB.6 on BB.5; BB.7 branches from
# integrate/phase-bb once BB.6 and BB.2 have merged (must_follow PR
# completion). Sprint order below is declaration order, not a strict
# dependency chain -- see the plan's sec.4 dependency-relations table for
# the actual must_follow/parallel_safe edges.
